  "body": "## Changelog\n* b4665b36fa5e9772a59fe0bb2e9ec367a07c50eb Rewrite help for fly extensions commands (#5508)\n* 6ae0e370de6e9b1c8a20dce4eb1db0c0b42b8a85 Send only the target org’s credentials on org-scoped requests (#5527)\n* fdeeb2bf03af4fed64397e45924cc49d74c86b72 Rewrite help for fly mpg commands (#5507)\n* 40aabddd449ba5b36eac9ae568d85bda3764dbf3 Keep fly launch --manifest stdout to the manifest JSON (#5523)\n* c31abfb752a4335156e94119439f93c3cb9b3d1c Use safe defaults when fly redis create runs without a TTY (#5486)\n* 4fbba12e51bb5a38ef3fb2275dd023483e0940b3 Test rules every command must follow (#5518)\n* 90d26b61e76eaae6de9af571ad17ef417b0deef9 Keep paragraphs and lists in --help output (#5506)\n* 24621770c0b0c321c741a55941085c76e61d8fcc Name fly auth signup and FLY_API_TOKEN when no token is available (#5532)\n* c1a02fad5e646ef17acf99000d7f67795082b0cc fix(deploy): settle in-flight replaces between recovery retries (#4985)\n* 8c56e46010685a90642e85c1a53d79f05b48c6b8 Clarify restart timeouts in flyctl (#5548)\n* ce4af718d2daf0f0ef8647bee5467dba6565ffb0 Reuse accepted Machine replacements during deploy recovery (#5547)\n\n"
}
